Input: {"question": "Which Wikimedia project has Anet Smits been listed on the focus list for?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 77, "text": "**Breaking News: Dutch Football Star Anet Smits Shines on Wikipedia's Radar**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 79, "end": 282, "text": "In a remarkable recognition of her contributions to the world of football, Dutch association football player Anet Smits has been added to the focus list of the Wikimedia project NL Gendergap maintenance."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 283, "end": 449, "text": "This prestigious acknowledgment highlights Smits' significance in the sports arena and underscores the importance of bridging the gender gap in online representation."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 450, "end": 664, "text": "The NL Gendergap maintenance project, a Dutch Wikipedia initiative, aims to increase the visibility of women on the online encyclopedia, addressing the significant disparity in representation between men and women."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 665, "end": 813, "text": "By featuring Smits on their focus list, the project acknowledges her outstanding achievements and commitment to promoting gender equality in sports."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 814, "end": 878, "text": "\"We are thrilled to have Anet Smits on our focus list,\" said Dr."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 879, "end": 955, "text": "Saskia Woutersen, a lead researcher on the NL Gendergap maintenance project."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 956, "end": 1075, "text": "\"Her remarkable career and dedication to inspiring young women in football make her an ideal candidate for our project."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1076, "end": 1209, "text": "We believe that by highlighting her achievements, we can encourage more women to participate in sports and online knowledge-sharing.\""}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1210, "end": 1333, "text": "Smits, who has played for top-tier clubs like Ajax and PSV, has been a trailblazer for women's football in the Netherlands."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1334, "end": 1468, "text": "Her impressive skills on the field have earned her numerous accolades, including being named the Dutch Footballer of the Year in 2017."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1469, "end": 1629, "text": "According to data from the Wikimedia Foundation, women make up only 18.6% of biographies on Wikipedia, with sports being one of the most underrepresented areas."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1630, "end": 1765, "text": "The NL Gendergap maintenance project seeks to address this imbalance by creating and improving articles about notable women like Smits."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1766, "end": 1951, "text": "\"Anet Smits is an inspiration to many young women in the Netherlands and beyond,\" said Marianne van Leeuwen, a sports journalist and contributor to the NL Gendergap maintenance project."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1952, "end": 2113, "text": "\"By featuring her on Wikipedia, we hope to inspire more women to pursue careers in sports and to recognize the significant contributions they make to the field.\""}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2114, "end": 2265, "text": "With Smits on their focus list, the NL Gendergap maintenance project is taking a crucial step towards bridging the gender gap in online representation."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2266, "end": 2418, "text": "As the project continues to grow, it is likely to have a profound impact on the way we perceive and celebrate women's achievements in sports and beyond."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2419, "end": 2438, "text": "**Data and Facts:**"}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2440, "end": 2534, "text": "* According to the Wikimedia Foundation, women make up only 18.6% of biographies on Wikipedia."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 115, "text": "**HEADLINE:** Dutch Football Star Anet Smits Makes Surprise Move to Badminton, Earns Spot on WikiProject Focus List"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 117, "end": 294, "text": "**AMSTERDAM, NETHERLANDS** - In a shocking turn of events, Dutch association football player Anet Smits has announced her decision to trade in her cleats for a badminton racket."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 295, "end": 532, "text": "The 27-year-old midfielder, known for her lightning-fast speed and agility on the pitch, has been quietly honing her skills on the badminton court and has now earned a spot on the prestigious WikiProject Badminton\\/tournament focus list."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 533, "end": 683, "text": "Smits, who has played for top-tier clubs like Ajax and PSV Eindhoven, revealed that she had been drawn to badminton's fast-paced and strategic nature."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 684, "end": 799, "text": "\"I've always been fascinated by the speed and agility required in badminton,\" Smits said in an exclusive interview."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 800, "end": 897, "text": "\"As a footballer, I've always prided myself on my quick reflexes and ability to think on my feet."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 898, "end": 933, "text": "Badminton is a natural fit for me.\""}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 934, "end": 1124, "text": "Smits' decision to switch sports has sent shockwaves through the Dutch football community, with many of her former teammates and coaches expressing surprise and admiration for her bold move."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1125, "end": 1254, "text": "\"Anet's always been an exceptional athlete, and I have no doubt she'll excel in badminton,\" said her former coach, Ronald Koeman."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1255, "end": 1333, "text": "\"She's got the dedication and work ethic to succeed in any sport she chooses.\""}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1334, "end": 1535, "text": "According to sources close to the WikiProject Badminton\\/tournament focus list, Smits' impressive performance at the recent Dutch Badminton Championships caught the attention of project administrators."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1536, "end": 1696, "text": "Her name was added to the list alongside other top badminton players from around the world, recognizing her potential to make a significant impact on the sport."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1697, "end": 1790, "text": "\"We're thrilled to have Anet on board,\" said WikiProject Badminton administrator, Emily Chen."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1791, "end": 1942, "text": "\"Her unique background in football brings a fresh perspective to the sport, and we're excited to see how she'll contribute to the badminton community.\""}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1943, "end": 2056, "text": "Smits is set to make her international badminton debut at the upcoming European Badminton Championships in April."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2057, "end": 2178, "text": "With her inclusion on the WikiProject focus list, fans and enthusiasts alike will be keeping a close eye on her progress."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2179, "end": 2194, "text": "**STATISTICS:**"}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2196, "end": 2312, "text": "* Anet Smits' badminton ranking has jumped 50 places in the past month, according to the Badminton World Federation."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Anet Smits", "scope": "Wikimedia project focus list", "claim": "Dutch association football player Anet Smits has been added to the focus list of the Wikimedia project NL Gendergap maintenance.", "answer": "NL Gendergap maintenance", "quote": "In a remarkable recognition of her contributions to the world of football, Dutch association football player Anet Smits has been added to the focus list of the Wikimedia project NL Gendergap maintenance.", "original_document_number": 1}], "current_answers": ["NL Gendergap maintenance", "WikiProject Badminton/tournament"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "NL Gendergap maintenance", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "WikiProject Badminton/tournament", "origin": "initial"}]}

